  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0009",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A New Look for O3",
          "_key": "k0010"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0011",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "We don’t just create digital experiences for our clients, we also do quite a bit of work for ourselves. We’re always working on something new, whether it’s a ",
          "_key": "k0012"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "new labs project",
          "_key": "k0013"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or ",
          "_key": "k0014"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "brainstorming fresh ideas",
          "_key": "k0015"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for ",
          "_key": "k0016"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0002"
          ],
          "text": "our clients",
          "_key": "k0017"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and we’re happy to show off the latest fruits of our labor: ",
          "_key": "k0018"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "our NEW website",
          "_key": "k0019"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Our site has gone through a major redesign, and we’re ready to share our work with you.",
          "_key": "k0020"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.o3world.com/labs/taskbot/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0001",
